# Buster Sword: the trigger is on the stack when Bot1 destroys the Sword with Disenchant. The ability still resolves (CR 113.7a): it
# draws, and "that damage" is still the 3 dealt, so Hop to It (MV 3) is cast free and makes three Rabbits. The Sword, destroyed, is in
# the graveyard. Disenchant (the turn's draw) is paid for with Mox Ruby and Mox Pearl.

